  "title": "· New Bags · Balenciaga Drops Qixi 26 Collection: Crystal Embellished Bags & Accessories",
  "original_title": "新包 | Balenciaga 上架七夕26系列包包和配饰：水晶烫饰",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga launches a 2026 Qixi capsule with crystal-adorned Le City bags and leather goods, featuring playful heart, bow, and star motifs.",
