      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga has just dropped its 2026 Qixi (Chinese Valentine's Day) capsule collection, featuring the new Le City motorcycle bag and small leather goods adorned with crystal motifs like hearts, bows, and stars. These playful embellishments resemble doodles from a lovestruck notebook, exuding sweet affection.",
