    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Qixi-exclusive Le City Moto mini bag is crafted from black suede calfskin, its deep backdrop highlighting shimmering crystal appliqués. Stars, bow ribbons, arrow-pierced hearts, hand-lettered Bs, and roses are scattered across the surface, like a lover's spontaneous graffiti or a constellation in the night sky—romantic and poetic.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
