    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Passport card holder is made of black semi-matte grained calfskin, with a gold-foil Balenciaga Lion Crest logo from the 1990s at the center, surrounded by crystal appliqués of hearts, bows, and stars. Inside, handwritten slogans like \"I ♥ U\" and \"I ♥ U 2\" appear alongside arrows pointing left or right. These playful motifs can be paired as couple accessories, with arrows facing each other to echo mutual feelings, or worn solo as a suggestive declaration with room for imagination.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
