    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The limited-edition Crystal B key ring features a black fine-grain lambskin B-letter pendant as its centerpiece, with crystal appliqués tracing the handwritten font. It comes with a pink padlock, keys, and other charms in zinc alloy, steel, and brass. The lock and key evoke promises and opening one's heart.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
