      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Midnight collection accessories feature joined heart pendants as the main motif, crafted from silver and antique silver brass. Each heart is half plain or fully crystal-set, with the other half engraved with a Gothic-style B letter. The collection includes necklaces, earrings, bracelets, and hair clip sets. The double necklace consists of two separate chains that can be layered together or shared with a \"soulmate\" as couple pieces.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
